@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlDetailsModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider operationalProvider;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlResults.GetDescription()} - {operationalProvider.CompanyName}";
}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">
        <a href="/operational/A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess/A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlSummary" class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i>&nbsp;Back</a>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">

        @if (operationalProvider.CompanyID == 0)
        {
            <span>Please select a company from the sidebar to see results.</span>
        }
        else
        {
            if (Model.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlDetailsItems.Count == 0)
            {
                <span>There are no offline devices for @operationalProvider.CompanyName</span>
            }
            else
            {
                <table class="table table-sm table-striped table-hover table-bordered">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Customer No</th>
                            <th scope="col">Customer Name</th>
                            <th scope="col">Occupancy Status</th>
                            <th scope="col" class="text-right">Balance</th>
                            <th scope="col">Account Type</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        @foreach (var itemC in Model.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlDetailsItems)
                        {
                            string rowclass = "";
                            string cellClass = "";
                            if (itemC.Status == MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess.StatusType.Ok)
                            {
                                rowclass = " class=\"table-success\"";
                                cellClass = " class=\"text-green font-weight-bold\"";
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                rowclass = " class=\"table-danger\"";
                                cellClass = " class=\"text-red font-weight-bold\"";
                            }
                            <tr @Html.Raw(rowclass) style="cursor:pointer;" title="@itemC.CustomerNo" onclick="RedirectToReview('@itemC.MeterSerial');">
                                <td scope="col">@itemC.CustomerNo</td>
                                <td scope="col">@itemC.CustomerName</td>
                                <td scope="col">@itemC.Occupancy</td>
                                <td scope="col" class="text-right">@itemC.Balance.ToMoney("R")</td>
                                <td scope="col">@itemC.AccountType</td>
                            </tr>
                        }
                        <tr>
                            <td class="border-table-total" colspan="3">Total</td>
                            <td class="border-table-total text-right">@(Model.A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlDetailsItems.Select(p => p.Balance).Sum().ToMoney("R"))</td>
                            <td class="border-table-total"></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            }
        }
    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        function RedirectToReview(serial) {
            document.location.href = '/operational/changeActiveMeter/' + serial + '?R=/operational/A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess/A07_CreditControlAndNotifierProcess_CreditControlReview';
        }
    </script>
}
